      "english_name": "Yang Ping",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100363"
    },
    "title": "秋日獨遊曲江",
    "poem": [
      "信馬閒過憶所親，秋山行盡路無塵。",
      "主人莫惜松陰醉，還有千錢沽酒人。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_289_010_01",
    "volume": 289,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊憑",
      "recorded": "楊憑",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ping",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100363"
    },
    "title": "寄別",
    "poem": [
      "晚煙洲霧共蒼蒼，河雁驚飛不作行。",
      "回旆轉舟行數里，歌聲猶自逐清湘。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_289_011_01",
    "volume": 289,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊憑",
      "recorded": "楊憑",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ping",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100363"
    },
    "title": "邊情",
    "poem": [
      "新種如今屢請和，玉關邊上幸無他。",
      "欲知北海苦辛處，看取節毛餘幾多。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_289_012_01",
    "volume": 289,
    "author": {
