      "recorded": "楊憑",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ping",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100363"
    },
    "title": "早發湘中",
    "poem": [
      "按節鳴笳中貴催，紅旌白旆滿船開。",
      "迎愁湓浦登城望，西見荊門積水來。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_289_013_01",
    "volume": 289,
    "author": {
