      "recorded": "楊憑",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ping",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100363"
    },
    "title": "海榴",
    "poem": [
      "海榴殷色透簾櫳，看盛看衰意欲同。",
      "若許三英隨五馬，便將濃豔鬬繁紅。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_289_014_01",
    "volume": 289,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊憑",
      "recorded": "楊憑",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ping",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100363"
    },
    "title": "春情",
    "poem": [
      "暮雨朝雲幾日歸，如絲如霧濕人衣。",
      "三湘二月春光早，莫逐狂風繚亂飛。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_289_015_01",
    "volume": 289,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊憑",
      "recorded": "楊憑",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ping",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100363"
    },
    "title": "送客往荊州",
    "poem": [
      "巴丘過日又登城，雲水湘東一日平。",
      "若愛春秋繁露學，正逢元凱鎮南荊。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_289_016_01",
    "volume": 289,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊憑",
